Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.77,0:00:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,可以自我介绍一下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我是叶月蕾拉\N叶月啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.81,0:00:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,今天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,要做什么可以说吗\N好的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.98,0:00:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,蹂躏超M的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.72,0:00:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有过这样的经历吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,有过的\N我男友是超M
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,妳交往的男友\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N是超M啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,舔腿 闻味道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头也很敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,还有做爱的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,互相舔 互相蹂躏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,会有反应是吧\N是的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.65,0:01:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,超M不会反抗\N可以说是很喜欢\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜欢超M吗\N是的 很可爱\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,很可爱 我就想蹂躏他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.17,0:01:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊\N是的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可以看看那边吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.14,0:01:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,有个楼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.74,0:01:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那个楼从一楼到五楼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有7个人\N不是吧\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.95,0:01:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.95,0:01:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,有人的哦\N这样啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,超M在等着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.06,0:01:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N好期待啊\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,可以去吗\N可以\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(想要被叶月蕾拉蹂躏的)\N(7个超M)\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.30,0:01:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,(被监禁在1-5楼)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,(彻底地蹂躏这些超M男)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.81,0:02:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,(女人吞噬男人)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,(叶月蕾拉和七个超M男)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.89,0:02:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,(1F暴行)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.93,0:02:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.61,0:02:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,里面有超M 摸蛋蛋的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,就会兴奋的变态
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.35,0:02:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让妳蹂躏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.19,0:02:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我好兴奋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.02,0:02:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,请蕾拉好好蹂躏我吧
