Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:03:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.91,0:03:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你是超M吗\N是的\N
