Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不就不能说话了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.89,0:03:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢我摸蛋蛋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
