Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.37,0:24:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,还有干劲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.31,0:24:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知不觉就欺负他了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.65,0:24:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.68,0:24:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去下一层吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.35,0:24:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这边哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.29,0:24:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.33,0:24:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,去上面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.56,0:24:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.66,0:24:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.94,0:24:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,(2F蹂躏脚 蹂躏屁股)
