Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.73,0:25:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.52,0:25:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢腿喜欢屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.69,0:25:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,想要蹂躏屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.39,0:25:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这样说的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.70,0:25:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢屁股啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.70,0:25:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,有个喜欢脚
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.94,0:25:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,两个人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.11,0:25:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好期待
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.94,0:25:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.69,0:26:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.97,0:26:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谁喜欢屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.64,0:26:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.44,0:26:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.91,0:26:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,翘起屁股 当做椅子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.74,0:26:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了\N快点\N
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.32,0:26:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才踢累了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.83,0:26:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,给我按摩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.66,0:26:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.27,0:26:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.84,0:26:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.44,0:26:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢脚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.94,0:26:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那就给我好好按摩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.25,0:27:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.82,0:27:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好累啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.60,0:27:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么擅自闻味道了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.33,0:27:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.94,0:27:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,出汗了 很臭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.11,0:27:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.44,0:27:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.01,0:27:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这样闻像狗一样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.19,0:27:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,像狗一样闻
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.12,0:27:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,突然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.39,0:27:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.73,0:27:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.66,0:27:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,闻吧\N好的\N
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.07,0:27:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.91,0:28:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.85,0:28:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,机会难得啊 再开心起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.85,0:28:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好开心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.49,0:28:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不是语言
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.19,0:28:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好好闻味道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.00,0:28:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.78,0:28:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真是变态呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.68,0:28:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.48,0:28:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,臭的味道让你兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.82,0:28:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.23,0:28:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.89,0:28:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不要忘记这里\N对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.67,0:29:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.31,0:29:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,像我这样年轻可爱的女孩
